{"t":"Anna","s":"anna-97a9d","k":"npc","i":"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_7_10ea82.png","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Anna</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geographical Properties</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNewhaven\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"city\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Nearest City</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"subarea\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Subarea</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Newhaven\">Newhaven</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group pi-horizontal-group-no-labels\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Map</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"posx\"><center><div class=\"map_image\" style=\"width:150px;display:inline-block;position: relative;\"><img alt=\"75?cb=20260713145837&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_7_10ea82.png\"/><div style=\"border-right: 1px dashed white;position: absolute;height: 100%;width: 50.6%;top: 0px;display: block;\"></div><div style=\"border-bottom: 1px dashed white;position: absolute;height: 50%;width: 100%;top: 0px;display: block;\"></div></div><div class=\"minimap_clic\" style=\"width:152px;display:block;text-align:right;font-size:14px\"><a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32552,32498,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Browse Map (32552, 32498, 7)</a></div></center></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n</div>\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Personal Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"gender\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Gender</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Female</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"race\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Race</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Human</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"job\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Job</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Ship Captain</div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">15.12.c7d92c<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">October 21, 2025<br/>Newhaven Update</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: NPCs <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20251025120102&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Anna_3c44b0.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"npc-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see Anna.</div></div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-twbox-bubble\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"NPC Bubble D\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/NPC_Bubble_D_215d07.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>Ready for a passage to the continent?</li><li>No fear! This ferry will take you safely to the island Targuna.</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>The <a href=\"#/wiki/Newhaven\">Newhaven</a> Docks.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Anna can transport players from <a href=\"#/wiki/Newhaven\">Newhaven</a> to <a href=\"#/wiki/Targuna\">Targuna</a> once they reach level 8.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-transcripts\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h3>\n<dl><dd><i>To change these transcripts, edit the transcripts page for Anna.</i></dd></dl>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\nPlayer: hi<br/>\nAnna: Hello, my friend. Do you seek <b>passage</b> to the island Targuna?<br/>\nPlayer: name<br/>\nAnna: My full name is Anna Maria Mauricia, but you may call me just Anna.<br/>\nPlayer: job<br/>\nAnna: I'm offering a ferry service to the island <b>Targuna</b>.<br/>\nPlayer: mainland / continent<br/>\nAnna: You chose a peaceful world. Not much danger from other adventurers. Just beware the monsters. Ask me for a <b>passage</b> if you're interested.<br/>\nPlayer: passage<br/>\nAnna: I'm offering a ferry service to the island Targuna, are you interested?<br/>\nPlayer: no<br/>\nAnna: You want to stay here for a little longer? All right, return if you are ready for a <b>passage</b>.<br/>\nPlayer: island / Newhaven<br/>\nAnna: Back when the mines were still full of ores, our island used to be a much busier place. Workers, suppliers and travelers from all over Tibia began visiting our small village.<br/>\nPlayer: Avriel<br/>\nAnna: Avriel runs a small shop here in the village. You can buy useful things there, but you can also sell things you no longer need. You will find his shop right south of the ferry house.<br/>\nPlayer: Flavius<br/>\nAnna: He runs the small bank in this village. You can find him over there in the house.<br/>\nPlayer: Gustavo<br/>\nAnna: He is a capable fighter and keeps our village safe from the Muglex Clan goblins.<br/>\nPlayer: Rosina<br/>\nAnna: Rosina lives on a small island west of here. She has a small guesthouse where travelers can stay for a few nights.<br/>\nPlayer: Viola<br/>\nAnna: Viola is a good friend of mine, she knows a thing or two about magic and literature. I heard she's missing a book, maybe you could help her out.<br/>\nPlayer: Tim<br/>\nAnna: He is a friend of our guard <b>Gustavo</b> but he lives in the capital <b>Thais</b>.<br/>\nPlayer: Ben<br/>\nAnna: Hmm, no one in the village has that name. Oh wait... <b>Gustavo</b> mentioned it once.<br/>\nPlayer: Targuna<br/>\nAnna: This small island is highly recommendable for inexperienced and first-time adventurers. It's not far from the city <b>Thais</b>, too. I can take you there if you like. Ask me for a <b>passage</b> if you're interested.<br/>\nPlayer: Thais<br/>\nAnna: Thais is actually the oldest city in Tibia. But be careful on those streets, there are bandits everywhere. ...<br/>\nAnna: It might be better if I take you to <b>Targuna</b>. Ask me for a <b>passage</b> if you're interested.<br/>\nPlayer: farewell / bye<br/>\nAnna: Take care!<br/>\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Anna</strong></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","quests":["newhaven-quest"],"pos":{"x":32552,"y":32498,"z":7}}